cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the elicited priors, please cite the paper."
title: "LLM-elicited coefficient priors under domain shift"
abstract: >-
  Code, elicited priors and results for a study of whether coefficient priors
  elicited from large language models improve out-of-distribution prediction
  when used as the shrinkage target of a regularised regression.
